  <Index>k__BackingField: 15
  <Title>k__BackingField: Offshore
  <Settings>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a4621c90bf8b4fb4f8d530d842f8c4a0, type: 2}
  description: Beyond the coast, the Shadow pumps the seabed from a fortified rig. Cross the beaches, sink the gunboats and take the Sea Fortress apart, launcher by launcher.
  introduces: Gunboats, bombers and kamikaze divers. The rig pays a fortune.
  hints:
  - Air-to-ground missiles hit ground targets only, and hard.
  - 'Kamikazes dive at you once they have chosen: sidestep late.'
